// THE MODEL HALF'S RESOURCES.
// The model half's bosses are declared here, each in the table below with what it is for; everything the
// panel needs - its bosses, menus, actions, views, pictures and strings - is in ui/KFCUI.fr, the UI half's
// resource. The strings this half writes itself (what Edit > Undo calls a KFC write) stay in KFC_enUS.fr.

// General includes:
#include "LocaleIndex.h"
#include "PMLocaleIds.h"
